window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Contains these three titles:</p> <p>Terran: Taurus King</p> <p>Augustine: Virgo King</p> <p>Kane: Capricorn King</p> <p>This spicy dark bwwm romance book bundle contains three of the \"earth signs\" from the zodiac.</p> <p>TERRAN: TAURUS KING</p> <p>A vicious winter storm sends Viola careening into the arms of a gruff, lonely farmer in an isolated small town.</p> <p>Terran hasn’t felt the touch of a woman in years.</p> <p>He prefers to live alone.</p> <p>Most women can’t handle him.</p> <p>He’s too gruff.</p> <p>Too stubborn.</p> <p>Too bull-headed.</p> <p>When vulnerable Viola lands in his lap, his lust takes a dark turn.</p> <p>AUGUSTINE: VIRGO KING</p> <p>Student loans are kicking in soon and the crisis looms over Trinity's head.</p> <p>She does what every other single, childless and soon to be smothered by rent millennial her age is doing...</p> <p>She signs up to become a mail order bride for the cost of her student loans.</p> <p>Being dark-skinned, plus-sized and unapologetically sassy in her profile, Trinity expects nothing.</p> <p>A little email announces her purchase with a first-class plane ticket to where? Alaska.</p> <p>Exactly where a black woman from Harlem does NOT want to go.</p> <p>If she wants to clear her $276,541.98 student loan balance, Trinity has no choice.</p> <p>KANE: CAPRICORN KING</p> <p>Three people dead and only a divorced single cop can solve the crime.</p> <p>His main “person of interest” is an attractive, successful black woman who seems shaken up.</p> <p>When she tries to escape, Kane risks everything to stop her.</p> <p>A stormy night, a highway chase and a devastating twist that lead the cop and his suspect to be trapped together in a cabin for a long snowy night changes everything.</p> <p>Kane was never the good guy, just a man in uniform.</p> <p>He can’t resist Belinda. Why bother?</p> <p>It's going to be a long, cold night and he MUST find a way to stay warm.</p>"; 
